[options]
[A.]
<$Playsound,forRain2.wav>

                                      <h2>Defending Rain Village<a href="#mission8">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>

                                        ~[IrainVortex.28]
<p>
<i>If the ice cannon gets warm it only shoots water<br>
                     ---Professor Sclittera at the Nimbian Science Center</i>
<p>
When the King of Hades found out of your alliance with Walir the Rain King he became enraged,
sending his henchman along with his Senior henchman to kill you.  You must now defend Rain
 Village at all costs<br>
or suffer the ~rALTAR~.!
<p>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                     <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                   <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>             <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Start the defendin...</a>             <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I wanna Leave!</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove3.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.



[ai7PriestDead]
The {sw_god1} speaks to you:<br>
<i>"You have help aid my warriors in battle and have defended the Rain village.
For that, I grant you knowledge:</i>
$Menu=~[IrainBattery.*]~yRain Battery,GetTechnology,76

[ai6PriestDead]
You hear a voice in your head. It's quiet, but it gets your attention, immediately.
It's the {sw_god1}, and he says to you:<br>
<i>"You need to learn the power of rain. I give you knowledge:</i>
$Menu=~yRain Cannon~[IrainCannon.3],GetTechnology,76

[ai3PriestDead]
The Furies must be battling amongst themselves! You find that you have gained some
energy from the Furies!
<$ChangeMoney,1500>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai5PriestDead]
The sky grows dark, and in an instant, there is a thunderous roar as Storm Crystals
rain down upon you! You quickly gather them up, and continue on your mission of defending
the Rain village...
<$ChangeMoney,5000>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>When I'm finished with the King of Water I'll get you.</h2>
                                    <i>--Herceant</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2TempleDead]
The Rain King says to you:
<h2><i>"Ally, I can no longer build bridges.  Please aid me before I lose my knowledge to Hades."</i></h2>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestCaptured]
Walir the Rain King sends you an urgent message:
<h2><i>"If you do not save me - all is lost"</i></h2>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
As Walir the Rain King is sacrificed, his last words are:
<i>"You are next.  Run!  Run for your life.</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
                                       <h2>Success!</h2>
You have repelled {sw_hades} forces for now, but there's no time to waste!
<p>
You hear that the {sw_god5} has scaled a massive attack on Rain City. The Rain Fury
requests your assistance, and not being too bright, or thinking about the consequences,
you immediately agree!
<$Config,sw_m8=0>
<$Config,sw_m14=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=6000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=3>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar4=3>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
$Button=Begin the Evacuation of Rain City,MissionBegin,sw_m14

[Failed]
<h2>You get a message from the Rain Fury.</h2>
<br>
<i>"You let me down Priest."</i>
<p>
You see a puff of smoke.<br>
Before you, stands the {sw_god5}, in all his evil glory!
<p>
You stagger and fall to your knees before him. You cry out:
~I"King Hades I am sorry I failed you!  Please give me a chance to join you now
so I can get the Rain Fury."<br>
King {sw_hades}, looks at you in disgust.<br>
<i>"Get off your knees, groveler. It's too late to switch sides now.
Don't worry. I know that you won't fail me again."</i>
<p>
With that, the god of ~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]~kDeath~.~[IbombExplodeLarge.1] leaves you, whining and wimpering on the ground.
You feel a chill run up your spine as you await your soul to be sacrificed.

<$Config,sw_m8=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=OH NO! Not Hades Altar!,MissionBegin,sw_m24

[END]
